# Internal docs, notes, SQL and tooling: repo-only. Serving them on the
# production domain let search engines and AI crawlers index files like
# STATUS.md and docs/SECURITY_FIXES_*.md under stocksaathi.co.in.
# Leading slash = repo root only. An unanchored "db/" also matched js/db/
# and took the app's Supabase modules off the deployment.
/docs/
*.md
# Dotfiles at the root were served as-is (S2: /.gitignore was public).
/.gitignore
/.vercelignore
/db/
/scripts/
/partials/
